  "title": {
   "en": "Emilone's Temptation Labyrinth (Promo)"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "에밀로네의 유혹 미궁"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Emilone-ui Yuhog Migung"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "*This is a promotional oneshot for [the novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/52376567).*\n\n---\nI was a popular actress before I came into this world and became Emilone, a Saintess. I was given the nickname “lady who moved dimensions.” Even so, I did not receive any special attention. All attention was on Princess Ronella Nestro. As a result, I decided to devote my life to being a Saintess. One day, I accidentally discovered the Princess’ secret. The Princess’ innocent and good-natured personality was all an act!\n\n“This might be interesting.”\n\nI may be able to break up my boring routine if I get closer to Princess Ronella. I decided to make a dangerous decision for fun."
  },
